Z||000000||gabriel||02-08-2001||11:11 AM||||Hi all.<P>  Ist, I'll say that this 84 had like every option installed & when I brought it (a week ago) exactly nothing worked.<P>  Okay, got the power windows working, fixed the power locks, stereo, AC, headlights, (thanks Rodney) but still have to figure the Window washer, elec. trunk lock & this strange little glitch:  Whenever I use the turn signals, the winshild wipers come on, run once & stop.  Before I consider pulling the wheel, does anyone have an idea on this?<P>   Thanks ||||reg||5
